    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_02",
      "hash64": "9F3E5D33C6DE47C3",
      "text": "How is your Treasure Hunt coming along?\\nHaving all sorts of fun adventures, I hope?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "92AF86A599929055",
      "text": "Yeah, it’s been great!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "92AF83A599928B3C",
      "text": "It’s not going so well...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_03a",
      "hash64": "753D1CFAEBB1B203",
      "text": "Wonderful. I’m glad to hear it.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_03b",
      "hash64": "753D1DFAEBB1B3B6",
      "text": "Oh my. Is that so...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_04",
      "hash64": "9F3E6333C6DE51F5",
      "text": "Do keep in mind that the Treasure Hunt has no\\nset course or criteria you must follow.\\c\\nSimply go where your heart takes you, and you\\nshall do splendidly.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 155,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_05",
      "hash64": "9F3E6233C6DE5042",
      "text": "Speaking of such pursuits, there has been\\nsomething on my mind of late.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_06",
      "hash64": "9F3E6133C6DE4E8F",
      "text": "If I could ask for your expertise on the matter,\\nI would be most grateful.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_07",
      "hash64": "9F3E6033C6DE4CDC",
      "text": "You see, I recently heard a word whose meaning\\nescapes me. I believe it to be some sort of slang.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_08",
      "hash64": "9F3E6733C6DE58C1",
      "text": "Tell me, what does “cheugy” mean?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_select_03",
      "hash64": "92AF84A599928CEF",
      "text": "Something super cool",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_select_04",
      "hash64": "92AF81A5999287D6",
      "text": "Being outdated and uncool",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_select_05",
      "hash64": "92AF82A599928989",
      "text": "It’s a really chewy gumball",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_09a",
      "hash64": "755F18FAEBCE919D",
      "text": "I see! So one might say, “Today’s lesson was the\\ncheugiest!” Is that right?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_09b",
      "hash64": "755F15FAEBCE8C84",
      "text": "Ah... I think I understand. For both speaker and\\nrecipient, it is not a pleasant word, I take it...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_09c",
      "hash64": "755F16FAEBCE8E37",
      "text": "A...very chewy gumball? So it is some sort of\\nconfection that children are partial to recently?\\c\\nI shall have to try one of these “cheugies” for\\nmyself sometime.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_10",
      "hash64": "9F3AD933C6DB31A0",
      "text": "The words used by young people these days are\\nquite often beyond my comprehension.\\c\\nBut when I learn the meanings behind the words,\\nI find that I feel that much closer to my students.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 185,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_11",
      "hash64": "9F3ADA33C6DB3353",
      "text": "I am most grateful to you for your help on\\nthat front.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_head_a_system",
      "hash64": "FF183FB623C60AA0",
      "text": "You became slightly closer with Director Clavell!",
      "flags": 0,
